common=' Actual class/source access, repertoire, level, action availability, components, costs, concentration transitions, Dissonance/Refrain and cast/counter/outcome hooks follow SPELL_INTEGRATION_RULES.md. These actual rank-1 placements have base 2 RP; real source modifiers and strain surcharges still apply. V is audible, S requires the ordinary usable free hand or an actual exception, and F is the ordinary class focus. A legal cast commits payment and cast-begin consequences before its Counterspell window; later failure/countering refunds nothing and restores no displaced concentration. Spell attacks use d20 + PB + actual casting modifier against AC; natural1 misses/natural20 hits and doubles only actual attack damage dice. Saves use DC8 + PB + actual casting modifier and binary-save rules. Actual target/area defenses and source-specific hooks retain their real trigger scopes. No automatic level scaling, generic upcast, new action budget or resource generation.'
minute='In initiative the maximum ends at the caster’s tenth future regular-turn START after application, excluding a start already underway/passed. Outside initiative it ends 60 elapsed seconds after application. Preserve the original regular/virtual marker or absolute deadline through initiative changes, extra turns, absence and travel; no timing-mode change resets the maximum.'
area=' Initial area targets are a snapshot at resolution, with no selective omission or later entry damage. Each affected creature uses its own save/defenses; a shared raw damage roll is not a shared defensive result. No Burning, Frozen, Deafened, Poisoned or other unnamed condition arises merely from the damage type.'
objects=' Objects must be independently legal targets with actual object AC, durability and material/damage defenses. This spell grants no generic permission to target an unwilling creature’s worn/carried equipment, no invented object statistics and no automatic secondary equipment damage.'
